# AWS — S3 (Quick Recipes)

Created: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC

## List Buckets (Access Check)
```sh
AWS_PROFILE=staging aws s3 ls
```

## List a Prefix
```sh
AWS_PROFILE=staging aws s3 ls s3://<bucket>/<prefix>/ --recursive | head -n 50
```

## Download a File
```sh
AWS_PROFILE=staging aws s3 cp s3://<bucket>/<key> ./local-copy
```

## Notes
- Prefer read-only access for investigations.
- Be mindful of downloading sensitive data; redact before attaching to tickets/PRs.

